---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Orlisia privacy policy.">
  <div class="category-header">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> &raquo; <span>Privacy Policy</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated October 14, 2026.</p>
  </div>

  <article class="article-single">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Orlisia collects minimal data. We use Google Analytics (GA4) to measure aggregate traffic — page views, referrers, device type, country. GA4 does not receive personally identifiable information from us, and we have not enabled Google signals that link visits to a Google account.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We do not set first-party cookies. GA4 sets its own cookies (or, in privacy-preserving mode, reads a small amount of storage) to distinguish unique visits. You can clear or block these at any time through your browser.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Some articles contain affiliate links. When you click through and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission at no cost to you. Affiliate relationships never determine which products or services are recommended in a guide.</p>

    <h2>Third-party content</h2>
    <p>Article images are hosted by Unsplash (when used as cover photos). Unsplash's privacy policy governs any data collection by their image CDN.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
